### Upload File
POST http://localhost:8001/files/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

id,name,email
1,João Silva,joao@email.com
2,Maria Santos,maria@email.com
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### List User Files
GET http://localhost:8001/files/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### List User Files with Pagination
GET http://localhost:8001/files/?skip=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get File Metadata
GET http://localhost:8001/files/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete File
DELETE http://localhost:8001/files/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE